{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37571","headline":"闻进士许彬罢举归睦州怅然怀寄 · 郑谷","name":"闻进士许彬罢举归睦州怅然怀寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐庐归旧庐，垂老复樵渔。\n吾子虽言命，乡人嬾读书。\n烟舟撑晚浦，雨屐翦春蔬。\n异代名方振，哀吟莫废初。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}